,"url":"https://avaloniaui.net/#:~:text=Avalonia%20uses%20XAML%20for%20layout%2C,patterns%20and%20skills%20transfer%20directly","text":"Avalonia uses XAML for layout, C# for logic, and MVVM for structure. If your team already builds with WPF, WinUI, or other .NET UI stacks, the patterns and skills transfer directly.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":10,"cited_message_id":"73133f45-b9a5-4d12-b615-ee885d42def8","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":100,"end_line_num":107,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":3150,"end_ix":3164,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"What Is Information Architecture? | Figma","url":"https://www.figma.com/resource-library/what-is-information-architecture/#:~:text=Information%20architecture%20is%20essential%20for,benefits%20of%20information%20architecture%20include","text":"Information architecture is essential for effective UX and UI design. It can dramatically impact your SEO and user engagement. Some key benefits of information architecture include:","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":35,"cited_message_id":"a34f6b95-2a73-4d68-8afa-37a64758ea43","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":278,"end_line_num":286,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":3358,"end_ix":3372,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"prefers-reduced-motion CSS media feature - CSS | MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/At-rules/@media/prefers-reduced-motion#:~:text=The%20%60prefers,based%20animations","text":"The `prefers-reduced-motion` CSS   88 is used to detect if a user has enabled a setting on their device to minimize the amount of non- essential motion. The setting is used to convey to the browser on the device that the user prefers an interface that removes, reduces, or replaces motion- based animations.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":37,"cited_message_id":"f103216d-67e0-4df2-96a7-7c7d8131cf44","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":204,"end_line_num":212,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":3423,"end_ix":3435,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"WebAIM: Keyboard Accessibility","url":"https://webaim.org/techniques/keyboard/#:~:text=Avoid%20,visibility%20of%20keyboard%20focus%20indicators","text":"Avoid `outline:0` or `outline:none` or other styles that remove or limit visibility of keyboard focus indicators.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":29,"cited_message_id":"fdb8300c-7d0b-44da-9cf3-effc4fc0d9be","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":63,"end_line_num":70,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":3571,"end_ix":3583,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"WebAIM: Keyboard Accessibility","url":"https://webaim.org/techniques/keyboard/#:~:text=Important","text":"Important","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":29,"cited_message_id":"fdb8300c-7d0b-44da-9cf3-effc4fc0d9be","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":31,"end_line_num":39,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":3642,"end_ix":3654,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"WebAIM: Keyboard Accessibility","url":"https://webaim.org/techniques/keyboard/#:~:text=Avoid%20,visibility%20of%20keyboard%20focus%20indicators","text":"Avoid `outline:0` or `outline:none` or other styles that remove or limit visibility of keyboard focus indicators.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":29,"cited_message_id":"fdb8300c-7d0b-44da-9cf3-effc4fc0d9be","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":63,"end_line_num":70,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":4314,"end_ix":4328,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"What Is Information Architecture? | Figma","url":"https://www.figma.com