y%20of%20keyboard%20focus%20indicators","text":"Avoid `outline:0` or `outline:none` or other styles that remove or limit visibility of keyboard focus indicators.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":29,"cited_message_id":"fdb8300c-7d0b-44da-9cf3-effc4fc0d9be","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":63,"end_line_num":70,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":6518,"end_ix":6532,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"prefers-reduced-motion CSS media feature - CSS | MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/At-rules/@media/prefers-reduced-motion#:~:text=The%20%60prefers,based%20animations","text":"The `prefers-reduced-motion` CSS   88 is used to detect if a user has enabled a setting on their device to minimize the amount of non- essential motion. The setting is used to convey to the browser on the device that the user prefers an interface that removes, reduces, or replaces motion- based animations.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":37,"cited_message_id":"f103216d-67e0-4df2-96a7-7c7d8131cf44","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":204,"end_line_num":212,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":7236,"end_ix":7248,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"WebAIM: Keyboard Accessibility","url":"https://webaim.org/techniques/keyboard/#:~:text=Important","text":"Important","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":29,"cited_message_id":"fdb8300c-7d0b-44da-9cf3-effc4fc0d9be","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":31,"end_line_num":39,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":7248,"end_ix":7262,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"prefers-reduced-motion CSS media feature - CSS | MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/At-rules/@media/prefers-reduced-motion#:~:text=The%20%60prefers,based%20ani